  ],
  "description": "Repairs r-str-ado-act/ado-bulk: GetRows stored only array bounds because the capture was not element-wise then, and the rows came from a fixture whose tables had been lost. On a client static read-only recordset of SELECT ID, Code, T, M FROM K ORDER BY ID (own copy of r-fix-wire-ado-ado5): GetRows(adGetRowsRest) and EOF; MoveFirst, GetRows(2, adBookmarkFirst, \"T\") and AbsolutePosition; MoveFirst, GetString(adClipString, -1, \"|\", \"\\n\", \"<null>\") and EOF; MoveFirst, GetString(adClipString) with defaults and EOF; Connection.Errors read and cleared after each call. Asks the array tag, bounds, each element's tag and value, and the strings.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
  "observationRecipe": [
    "clearErrorInfoBefore",
    "excepinfo",
    "deferredFill",
    "errorInfo"
  ],
